# Consolidates the multiple name/email identities each contributor used across
# the GIU Nexus history into one canonical entry per person, so `git shortlog`,
# `git log`, and GitHub's contributor view show one line per human.
#
# Format:
#   Canonical Name <canonical-email>                     -> normalises the name for that email
#   Canonical Name <canonical-email> <other-email>       -> also folds in a second email
#
# Every email below already appears verbatim in the public commit history — this
# file only groups them, it does not expose anything new.

